"CS1001","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[66,71,38,36,56,48],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1004702","armor":"WP1008105","helmet":"WP1020905"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1041","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[66,71,38,36,56,48],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1004702","armor":"WP1008105","helmet":"WP1020905"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"魏国武将。曹真率兵对抗诸葛亮北伐时，命朱赞为先锋进攻祁山，却中了诸葛亮之计误杀友军，又见蜀军与西羌兵交战后擅自带兵追击，被赵云所杀。","tc":"魏國武將。曹真率兵對抗諸葛亮北伐時，命朱贊為先鋒進攻祁山，卻中了諸葛亮之計誤殺友軍，又見蜀軍與西羌兵交戰后擅自帶兵追擊，被趙云所殺。","en":"An officer of Wei. When Cao Zhen led his forces to counter Zhuge Liang's Northern Expedition, he appointed Zhu Zan as vanguard to attack Qishan. However, Zhu Zan fell for Zhuge Liang's stratagem and mistakenly killed allied troops. Later, upon seeing the Shu army clash with Western Qiang forces, he took it upon himself to pursue them and was slain by Zhao Yun.","jp":"魏の武将。曹真が兵を率いて諸葛亮の北伐に対抗した際、朱賛を先鋒に任じて祁山へ進攻させたが、諸葛亮の計略にかかり友軍を誤殺してしまう。その後、蜀軍と西羌兵が交戦したのを見て独断で兵を率いて追撃するも、趙雲に討ち取られた。","kr":"위나라의 무장입니다. 조진이 군사를 이끌고 제갈량의 북벌에 맞설 때, 주찬을 선봉으로 삼아 기산을 공격하게 하였으나 제갈량의 계책에 빠져 아군을 오인하여 죽였습니다. 이후 촉군이 서강병과 교전하는 것을 보고 독단으로 군사를 이끌고 추격했다가 조운에게 죽임을 당했습니다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10783","remark":"","surname":"朱","surnameTc":"朱","surnameEn":"Zhu","surnameJp":"朱","surnameKr":"주","surnameOther":"","name":"赞","nameTc":"贊","nameEn":"Zan","nameJp":"賛","nameKr":"찬","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"朱赞","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"0","workYear":"209","city":"CS